{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411230","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1441123001:1":{"text":"가끔은 지상에 올라와서 바람도 쐬고 산책도 하고... 좋네.","source_cn":"偶尔到地面上散散步，透透气，真不错嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B639BA06E74DB04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441123002:0":{"text":"이건...","source_cn":"这是……<key:dialog141>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DC6F3E16F32C6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441123003:1":{"text":"이건 바다고, 이건 해변, 그리고 이건 파도야.","source_cn":"这是大海，这是沙滩，这是海浪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2587D24B41AEB499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441123004:1":{"text":"이건 칠면조, 이건 양이고, 이건 날아다니는 새지!","source_cn":"这是火鸡，这是绵羊，这是飞鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC480C5B23C4E98C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441123005:1":{"text":"궁금한게 많지? 걱정 마. 내가 천천히 알려줄게.","source_cn":"是不是还有很多问题想问？不着急，慢慢学。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC7F65C4648E855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1441123006:1":{"text":"여긴 지상에서도 깊은바위 마을이라는 작은 장소일 뿐이야. 바깥 세상은 훨씬 넓어.","source_cn":"这还只是深岩村这一小片地方，外面的世界大得很呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6812A7CCD5CA49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1441123006":{"text":"여긴 지상에서도 깊은바위 마을이라는 작은 장소일 뿐이야. 바깥 세상은 훨씬 넓어.","source_cn":"这还只是深岩村这一小片地方，外面的世界大得很呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6812A7CCD5CA49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1441123007:1":{"text":"네, 상상하던 모습이랑 완전히 다릅니다... 하지만, 그래서 더 좋군요.","source_cn":"是和想象中完全不同的世界……但这样就很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC114AA602BBDCE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1441123008:1":{"text":"다른 종족, 다른 환경... 하지만 똑같이 생기가 가득하네요.","source_cn":"族群不同，环境不同，但却同样充满生机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EA69DBDD10E93CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1441123009:1":{"text":"지상 세계의 규칙은 셀로클랜드와 완전히 다른가요?","source_cn":"外面的世界运行规则和萨洛克兰不同吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6868355C83858F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1441123009":{"text":"지상 세계의 규칙은 